    "narrative": "Today\u2019s lineup for the Austin Waves is anchored by **Gunnar Henderson** (83.29), who earns the top spot in our rankings. Facing Luis Severino (4.60 xERA), **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from an optimal leadoff position and a favorable park environment that inflates his raw projection. We are also high on **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.99) against Sandy Alcantara; while Alcantara can be formidable, the specific combination of the stadium\u2019s dimensions and the platoon advantage yields a strong efficiency score. **Jacob Wilson** (71.88) also warrants attention, as his park factor surge against Akin makes him one of our most efficient plays despite hitting in the middle of the order.\n\nThe most difficult decision on our bench involved **Nasim Nunez** (55.82). While **Nasim Nunez** offers elite speed\u2014a high priority given our focus on the scarcity of stolen bases\u2014his projection was hampered by a bottom-of-the-order assignment against Sandy Alcantara. Ultimately, the higher offensive ceilings provided by the middle-of-the-order bats like **Kyle Tucker** (69.76) and **Jackson Merrill** (66.29) forced **Nasim Nunez** to the pine. We continue to monitor the status of **Luis Robert Jr.**, who remains sidelined on the IL, leaving our outfield depth to be carried by **Andy Pages** (61.96) and the platoon-advantaged **Jackson Merrill**.\n\nInvestors should keep a close eye on the matchup against Logan Gilbert. While **Sam Antonacci** (43.60) is currently projected to start, his efficiency is heavily weighed down by Gilbert's elite underlying metrics (3.09 xERA), effectively rendering him a marginal start. Should any weather risks emerge or lineup changes shift **Liam Hicks** or **Drake Baldwin** out of their respective spots, we may see a further contraction in our daily efficiency. Otherwise, the current configuration maximizes our exposure to the most favorable pitcher matchups, specifically leveraging the platoon advantages for **Brady House** and **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** against right-handed opposition.",
